        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Once She-Ra steps back through the portal, she is about to be pissed at Catra, ready to finally cut ties with her completely, but when they all come back to reality, Catra is lying there on the floor, in a puddle of blood, unmoving. And Adora changes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What if the glitched parts of Catra from the alternate universe in 3.5-6 didnâ€™t â€œloadâ€ back into regular reality? What if they both came back wrong?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
